  "title": "Multimodal, Semantic, And Agentic Enterprise Data Consumption Is The Future",
  "summary": "The core question that has consumed analytics and business intelligence leaders for years is, “What is the one best way for business users to consume data?” The answer has at times been reports, dashboards, or low-code GUI-based self-service analytics. The latest answer is generative AI-based natural language prompts. Maybe we have the question wrong. Perhaps […]",
